{
  "type": "minecraft:notice",
  "title": "Other Features",
  "external_title": "Other Features",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Other Features",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "dark_green"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mob Statues",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "On Pandamium, some mobs can be created by placing a pumpkin on certain blocks, like vanilla golems",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Illusioner",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "dark_aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nCan be spawned by placing a pumpkin on top of 2 lapis blocks",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Creaking",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "dark_aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nCan be spawned by placing a pale oak log, a creaking heart, and a pumpkin on top",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Shulker",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "dark_aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nCan be spawned by placing a purpur block, shulker box of any color, and a pumpkin on top",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "The spawned shulker's color depends on the color of shulker box you placed",
          "color": "gray",
          "italic": true
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nLock Name/Disable Sound of Mobs",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Using a name tag with the name \"#\" on any mob will open a menu, allowing you to Disable its sounds or Lock its name so someone cant then change it",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedrock Breaker",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Bedrock Breaker Pickaxes can be bought from the vote shop\n",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "/trigger vote_shop",
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nAnd allow you to break bedrock, except for the exit end portal and end gateways.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Breaking a bedrock block at the bottom of the world turns it into a Barrier block.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Shift Left Clicking on said Barrier blocks turns them back into bedrock.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    }
  ],
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "pause": false,
  "after_action": "none",
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "translate": "gui.back"
    },
    "action": {
      "type": "minecraft:run_command",
      "command": "trigger help set 8"
    }
  }
}
